{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Definitely Sneaky But Not Sneaky is a top-down action game with increasing difficulty levels. Earn points by efficiently completing missions to unlock different weapons, items, and skills you can combine into custom loadouts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-person local multiplayer supports mixing different control types (one player on a keyboard, another on a PS4 controller, and a third on an Xbox controller, etc.) to get as many people playing as possible. Use Steam's <i>Remote Play</i> feature to play with other Steam users with just one copy of the game! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action-Stealth gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach missions in different ways depending on your loadout and strategy. Take out enemies before they notice you with close-ranged melee and silenced weapons! Or run in with a shotgun and some grenades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow-motion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-motion effects activate throughout the game. Use them to your advantage to  get extra time to make decisions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play local co-op versus with 2-4 players. Go free-for-all or split into teams! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive never-ending waves of zombies, purchase upgrades with kills, and explore the larger maps! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission editor with Steam Workshop integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the built-in editor, create all the missions you can see in the Missions mode and more! Create missions, string them into mission packs, and share them with the Steam community via Steam Workshop. Download others' published packs to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamepad support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With both keyboard/mouse and controller support, you can play the game whichever way is most comfortable. However, <strong>the game plays better with a controller</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"85d4ca8eeac6d289385a518121ec54512726fd15.jpg","localized_name":"On Your Way","name":"On Your Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/85d4ca8eeac6d289385a518121ec54512726fd15.jpg"},{"icon":"a3baf7bbeefe672f64291d76f18551f6f299ccfa.jpg","localized_name":"Murderer","name":"Murderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/a3baf7bbeefe672f64291d76f18551f6f299ccfa.jpg"},{"icon":"bf236560476291e6cc59d92dfb470ff68aacfa2a.jpg","localized_name":"Die","name":"Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/bf236560476291e6cc59d92dfb470ff68aacfa2a.jpg"},{"icon":"db5d1b209524087cceb23ad36c017f88a8648cbf.jpg","localized_name":"Sneaky","name":"Sneaky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/db5d1b209524087cceb23ad36c017f88a8648cbf.jpg"},{"icon":"8b47496c5461f2d1b18bc57d566d165a344c2f1e.jpg","localized_name":"Sneakier","name":"Sneakier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/8b47496c5461f2d1b18bc57d566d165a344c2f1e.jpg"},{"icon":"a709c7b5dc40c36e383cb4b224f8476dcdfa6231.jpg","localized_name":"Home Run","name":"Home Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/a709c7b5dc40c36e383cb4b224f8476dcdfa6231.jpg"},{"icon":"646d358614bed5f070ecb537692215cf8ea644cf.jpg","localized_name":"Teamwork","name":"Teamwork","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/646d358614bed5f070ecb537692215cf8ea644cf.jpg"},{"icon":"82803e79d78380f3b3d1cb06b925c12e180baaa8.jpg","localized_name":"Modder","name":"Modder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/954010/82803e79d78380f3b3d1cb06b925c12e180baaa8.jpg"},{"icon":"171751a200e79ecd6b74a392c4d9f0dd7fa2fdbf.jpg","localized_name":"Boom","name":"B